  "text": "COMPLETED DOCUMENT Hello ++rbc_email++, A new document has been sent to you, To view and sign click on the button below. VIEW DOCUMENT Do Not Share This Email This email contains a confidential link. Please ensure that neither the message, link, nor access code is shared with others. Be cognizant all this is done to ascertain our KUSA needs are addressed, therefore, I will do what is needed to close this deal and satisfy PAYETTE&rsquo;s need. If I did not send a reminder this morning, it would have sat in their laptops, and this is what you need to address with KISA, as to the turnaround time on requests made by us. I do not like to bother them at all, and try to satisfy all on my own with the information I have, or simply conduct my own test in warehouse, but with an order of 240K I do not want to take any risks, or place is in a precarious position. Thank you and will apprise after my meeting. Great evening. Password Expiration Notification Password Expiration Notification Walter Adolf Pl&uacute;as, LEED&reg; AP ID+C, CDT, Associate Architectural Specifications Manager &ndash; Technical Director Linkedin: www.linkedin.com/in/walteradolfpluas Email: ++rbc_email++ Office: (973) 246-8181 Mobile: (954) 774-8675 www.klein-usa.com On 7 Feb 2023, at 18:06, Jon Edward Eckstrom - Klein USA <salesmanager@klein-usa.com> wrote: Oh my goodness ~ that call with Noel is at an atrocious time 😵&zwj;💫 Thanks for the update and try to get a good nap in the interim before your call. I appreciate your dedication ~ Thank you, Sir! Jon Edward Eckstrom Head of Sales - USA c: 281.620.7509 www.Klein-USA.com From: Walter Adolf - Klein USA <sales4@klein-usa.com> Sent: Tuesday, February 7, 2023 5:02:28 PM To: Jon Edward Eckstrom - Klein USA <salesmanager@klein-usa.com> Subject: NEW PROJECT ADD Good evening sir. Please be so kind to ADD the following project as this will be closed within the next month/4 weeks. Did my last submittals this afternoon. ALLEN & GERRITSEN aka A & G INTERIOR FIT OUT | Salesforce $29,000 quote number 36939 PRODUCT: EXTENDO 6 units plus extra accessories. All others status quo as of this evening. I am having a conference call with NOEL at, or around 1:30AM to close the WESLEYAN JOB. Great evening. Walter Adolf Pl&uacute;as, LEED&reg; AP ID+C, CDT, Associate Architectural Specifications Manager &ndash; Technical Director Linkedin: www.linkedin.com/in/walteradolfpluas Email: ++rbc_email++ Office: (973) 246-8181 Mobile: (954) 774-8675 www.klein-usa.com </div"
