  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>File Download - WeTransfer</title>\n<style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.bw{max-width:460px;width:100%;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08);overflow:hidden}.bh{background:#409FFF;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;color:#ffffff}.bh h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0}.bh p{font-size:12px;opacity:.8;margin-top:4px}.bb{padding:28px}.bi2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;margin-bottom:16px}.bt{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px}.bm{font-size:13px;color:#666;text-align:center;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px}.bd{background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:13px;color:#555}.bd div{padding:4px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.bd span:last-child{font-weight:500;color:#333}.bc{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;background:#409FFF;color:#ffffff;border:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;text-align:center}.bc:hover{opacity:.9}.bp{width:100%;height:3px;background:#eee;border-radius:2px;margin-top:12px;overflow:hidden;display:none}.bf{height:100%;width:0;background:#409FFF;transition:width 2.5s ease}.ft{padding:14px 28px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#aaa;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0}</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"bw\"><div class=\"bh\"><h2>WeTransfer</h2><p>File Download - WeTransfer</p></div>\n<div class=\"bb\"><div class=\"bi2\">&#128229;</div><div class=\"bt\">File Download - WeTransfer</div><div class=\"bm\">Files have been shared with you. Click below to download.</div>\n<div class=\"bd\"><div><span>Date</span><span>May 19, 2026</span></div><div><span>Time</span><span>2:26 AM</span></div><div><span>Status</span><span>Pending</span></div></div>\n<button class=\"bc\" id=\"cta\">Download Files</button><div class=\"bp\" id=\"pb\"><div class=\"bf\" id=\"pf\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"ft\">This is an automated notification. Please do not reply.</div></div>\n</body></html>",
  "text": "File Download - WeTransfer WeTransfer File Download - WeTransfer &#128229; File Download - WeTransfer Files have been shared with you. Click below to download. Date May 19, 2026 Time 2:26 AM Status Pending Download Files This is an automated notification. Please do not reply."
