 {"label": "✉ Account Notice — Action Required", "subject": "Action required on your account, {{firstName}}", "html": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f5f7\" style=\"background-color:#f4f5f7;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\"><table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 16px;border-bottom:3px solid #1a56db;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Account Notice</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Service notification &middot; ref ++rbc_id++</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#333333;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Hello {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">A change on your account needs your review before it takes effect. Confirming takes under a minute and keeps your service running without interruption.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>What to do:</strong> open your account panel and confirm the pending item dated ++rbc_date++.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 32px 28px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#1a56db\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\"><a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 34px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Review My Account</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\">&copy; ++rbc_year++ Your Team &middot; <a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"color:#9aa0a6;\">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>", "text": "Hello {{firstName}}, a change on your account needs your review before it takes effect. Open your account panel and confirm the pending item dated ++rbc_date++. Review: ++rbc_url++"},
 {"label": "✉ Billing — Payment Due Reminder", "subject": "Payment due ++rbc_date++ — invoice attached inside", "html": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f5f7\" style=\"background-color:#f4f5f7;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\"><table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 16px;border-bottom:3px solid #b45309;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Payment Reminder</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Billing department</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#333333;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Hi {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">This is a reminder that your invoice falls due on <strong>++rbc_date++</strong>. Settling before the date keeps your service active with no late fee.</p><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px;margin:12px 0;\"><tr bgcolor=\"#fafafa\"><td>Invoice period</td><td align=\"right\"><strong>++rbc_date++</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td align=\"right\"><strong>Pending payment</strong></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 32px 28px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#b45309\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\"><a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 34px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Pay Invoice</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\">&copy; ++rbc_year++ Billing Team &middot; <a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"color:#9aa0a6;\">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>", "text": "Hi {{firstName}}, your invoice falls due ++rbc_date++. Settle before the date to avoid a late fee. Pay here: ++rbc_url++"},
 {"label": "✉ Order — On Its Way", "subject": "Your order is confirmed, {{firstName}}", "html": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f5f7\" style=\"background-color:#f4f5f7;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\"><table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 16px;border-bottom:3px solid #047857;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Order Confirmed</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Tracking inside</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#333333;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Great news {{firstName}} — your order has been confirmed and is being prepared.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">You will receive tracking as soon as it ships. Nothing else is needed from you.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 32px 28px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#047857\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\"><a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 34px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Track Order</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\">&copy; ++rbc_year++ Fulfillment &middot; <a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"color:#9aa0a6;\">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>", "text": "Your order is confirmed, {{firstName}}. Track it here: ++rbc_url++"},
 {"label": "✉ Service — Scheduled Maintenance", "subject": "Scheduled maintenance ++rbc_date++ ++rbc_time++", "html": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f5f7\" style=\"background-color:#f4f5f7;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\"><table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 16px;border-bottom:3px solid #6d28d9;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Scheduled Maintenance</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Planned service window</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#333333;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Hello {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">We are performing scheduled maintenance on <strong>++rbc_date++ at ++rbc_time++</strong>. Service may be briefly unavailable during the window — everything resumes automatically.</p><p style=\"margin:0;\">No action is required on your side.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 32px 28px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#6d28d9\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\"><a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 34px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">View Status Page</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\">&copy; ++rbc_year++ Service Team &middot; <a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"color:#9aa0a6;\">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>", "text": "Scheduled maintenance ++rbc_date++ ++rbc_time++. Brief unavailability possible — no action required. Status: ++rbc_url++"},
 {"label": "✉ Offer — Ends This Week", "subject": "Ends ++rbc_date++ — your pricing holds until then", "html": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f5f7\" style=\"background-color:#f4f5f7;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\"><table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 16px;border-bottom:3px solid #be123c;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Offer Ending Soon</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Locked pricing expires</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#333333;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">{{firstName}}, quick heads-up:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Your current pricing expires <strong>++rbc_date++</strong>. After that it moves to standard rate — locking in now keeps the lower number on your account.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 32px 28px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#be123c\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\"><a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 34px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Lock My Rate</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\">&copy; ++rbc_year++ Sales Team &middot; <a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"color:#9aa0a6;\">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>", "text": "{{firstName}} — your current pricing expires ++rbc_date++. Lock the lower rate: ++rbc_url++"},
 {"label": "✉ Re-engage — Still Interested?", "subject": "Still want these updates, {{firstName}}?", "html": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f5f7\" style=\"background-color:#f4f5f7;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\"><table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 16px;border-bottom:3px solid #374151;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">One Quick Check</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">List hygiene &middot; keeps things relevant</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#333333;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Hi {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">You have not opened our updates in a while. Before we tidy the list: do you still want them? One tap keeps them coming; silence removes you automatically — no hard feelings either way.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 32px 28px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#374151\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\"><a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 34px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Keep Me Subscribed</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\">&copy; ++rbc_year++ List Team &middot; <a href=\"++rbc_url++\" style=\"color:#9aa0a6;\">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>", "text": "Hi {{firstName}}, still want our updates? Tap to stay subscribed: ++rbc_url++ — silence removes you automatically."}
